&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2061&quot;&gt;Passionate about clean energy, fuel recycling, and efficient stewardship of natural resources&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2158&quot;&gt;An optimist at heart&lt;/p&gt;
