&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Core Mechanical Design Engineer that is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1857&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ca5c555-f050-434c-bcdf-b2249fbd9ea8&quot;&gt;Competent in 3D modeling software and has a solid understanding of mechanical design principals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1956&quot; data-local-id=&quot;756ffd27-69ee-445b-b8d4-a5a2c062043c&quot;&gt;An experienced team player who can work effectively across both internal resources and external suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2065&quot; data-local-id=&quot;515af941-7a56-476a-b541-3816b83afb57&quot;&gt;Passionate about clean energy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2099&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b47ffb85-60b4-44dd-a9ff-f80a5f559cbe&quot;&gt;An optimist at heart&lt;/li&gt;
