&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2147059a07f8&quot;&gt;Background in designing components for high-integrity or safety-critical systems (e.g., nuclear, aerospace, defense, or heavy industry)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2147059a07f8&quot;&gt;Proven ability to lead hardware projects through the full development cycle—from concept and design to testing and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2147059a07f8&quot;&gt;Knowledge of large scale fabrication techniques and transportation/handling of large components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2147059a07f8&quot;&gt;Understanding of thermal-mechanical analysis principles, with experience designing for high-temperature environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2147059a07f8&quot;&gt;Basic knowledge of nuclear fission and radiation effects on materials and components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2147059a07f8&quot;&gt;Exposure to simulation tools (e.g., ANSYS) and scripting languages (e.g., Python) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
