&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for a Mechanical Engineer to join our Fuel Recycling Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;138&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ce847ce0f8be&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mechanical Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; supporting our nuclear waste treatment systems, you will develop waste processing equipment from concept through deployment. Rather than performing detailed equipment design yourself, you will define process and mechanical requirements, work closely with equipment vendors, and ensure systems are practical, maintainable, and ready for operation in a nuclear environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;536&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cb4f2a27ef92&quot;&gt;You will translate waste processing objectives into equipment requirements, operating concepts, vendor specifications, and acceptance criteria while evaluating designs for maintainability, reliability, contamination control, remote operation, and regulatory compliance. Success in this role requires sound mechanical engineering judgment, an understanding of industrial process equipment, and the ability to recognize when a design is overly complex, under-specified, or not ready for production use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1038&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea18b6a5697f&quot;&gt;This role on the waste engineering team works closely with process engineering, mechanical design, controls, safety, radiation protection, licensing, procurement, operations, and external vendors to deliver integrated waste treatment systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1324&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3e8565e39952&quot;&gt;Develop mechanical requirements, equipment specifications, acceptance criteria, and operating concepts for radioactive waste treatment systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Translate process requirements into practical equipment solutions for waste processing, packaging, storage, and material handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Evaluate vendor designs for functionality, maintainability, reliability, contamination control, remote operation, and lifecycle performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Develop and review equipment layouts, P&amp;amp;IDs, material handling flows, tooling concepts, and mechanical interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify designs, improve operability, reduce maintenance burden, and increase production readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Support procurement by finding relevant vendors, preparing technical specifications, evaluating vendor proposals, and reviewing design deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Lead or participate in multidisciplinary design reviews and drive technical action items to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Develop engineering documentation including design bases, interface definitions, design evaluations, and technical reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb607260967c&quot;&gt;Support hazard analyses, licensing activities, commissioning, and facility integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3687&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b15332ad7df7&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical Engineering or a related engineering field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3687&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b15332ad7df7&quot;&gt;Minimum of 5 years of relevant engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3822&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d845c7d650d&quot;&gt;Experience developing, specifying, integrating, or implementing industrial process equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3822&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d845c7d650d&quot;&gt;Experience working with equipment vendors, technical specifications, procurement packages, or design reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3822&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d845c7d650d&quot;&gt;Experience with 3D CAD tools, 2D fabrication drawings, equipment specifications, and controlled design documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3822&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d845c7d650d&quot;&gt;Familiarity with P&amp;amp;IDs, mechanical equipment layouts, process equipment interfaces, material handling concepts, and vendor design packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3822&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d845c7d650d&quot;&gt;Strong mechanical engineering judgment, including practical understanding of maintainability, reliability, fabrication, inspection, and failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3822&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d845c7d650d&quot;&gt;Experience coordinating work across multiple engineering disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3822&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d845c7d650d&quot;&gt;Ability to produce clear, traceable technical documentation in support of design development, procurement, safety review, or licensing activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Experience in nuclear, chemical processing, mining, manufacturing, or other highly regulated industrial facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Experience in commercial nuclear, DOE, advanced reactor, fuel cycle, waste treatment, or high-reliability industrial projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Experience with radioactive waste processing, packaging, containerization, storage, or disposal systems in a hot-cell environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Experience developing equipment for size reduction, compaction, filtration, solidification, packaging, container handling, drum handling, cask/canister interfaces, or remote/assisted maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Familiarity with waste characterization, waste acceptance criteria, contamination control, ALARA principles, or radiological work planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Familiarity with radioactive waste classification, regulation, or nuclear material packaging requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Experience with design for manufacturability, design for automation, or design for remote handling and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Experience with Solidworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5eb69f22f62f&quot;&gt;Experience supporting hazard analysis, failure modes analysis, commissioning, readiness reviews, or startup of industrial process systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Mechanical Engineer who is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Practical, production-focused, and able to distinguish between a concept that works on paper and a system that can be operated and maintained&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Experienced in mechanical design of industrial process equipment, material handling systems, packaging systems, and waste processing equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Comfortable translating process objectives into equipment requirements, vendor specifications, operating sequences, and acceptance criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Skilled at reviewing P&amp;amp;IDs, equipment layouts, mechanical interfaces, and vendor drawings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Able to identify maintainability, reliability, operability, and implementation risks early in design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Effective working across engineering disciplines and with external suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Comfortable driving technical issues to resolution in a fast-paced development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Clear and direct in written and verbal communication, including design review comments and technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Energized by developing safe, compliant, and practical systems for radioactive waste processing and handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb324f98aad&quot;&gt;Willing to propose creative, technically grounded solutions rather than relying only on precedent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $120,000-$170,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, bonuses, competitive pay, 401(k), health insurance (with employer contribution), HSA, FSA, flexible work hours, wellness credits, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position may involve access to information subject to U.S. export control laws. Only applicants who meet the definition of a U.S. person under applicable laws may be eligible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;@oklo.com&lt;/span&gt; email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo!&amp;nbsp; We are searching for a&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Network Systems Technician&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;230&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71fdec52cdb1&quot;&gt;Oklo, Inc. is seeking a skilled and hands-on Network Systems Technician to support and maintain the company’s network infrastructure, endpoint connectivity, and on-site IT systems. This role is focused on ensuring reliable, secure, and high-performing network and systems operations across Oklo’s offices, labs, and collaboration spaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;569&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7b1196fbb86c&quot;&gt;The Network Systems Technician will work closely with the IT/Cyber team to support daily operations, troubleshoot network and system issues, and assist with infrastructure upgrades in a fast-paced, mission-driven environment. This position is ideal for someone who enjoys being close to the hardware, solving real-world connectivity problems, and providing excellent technical support to users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;569&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7b1196fbb86c&quot;&gt;This is an on-site position in Santa Clara, CA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;Network-&amp;amp;-Connectivity-Support&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7f595fbe8078&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;993&quot;&gt;Network &amp;amp; Connectivity Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5157bbc83823&quot;&gt;Support and maintain wired and wireless network infrastructure, including switches, access points, firewalls, and cabling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5157bbc83823&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot network connectivity issues across user endpoints, conference rooms, labs, and office environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5157bbc83823&quot;&gt;Assist with network configuration tasks such as VLANs, DNS, DHCP, and IP addressing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5157bbc83823&quot;&gt;Support VPN and secure remote access solutions in coordination with the IT/Cyber team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;Systems-&amp;amp;-Endpoint-Support&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a60608009e5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Endpoint Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1473&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8eb9fdab588&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on support for user endpoints running macOS, Ubuntu/Linux, and Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1473&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8eb9fdab588&quot;&gt;Assist with provisioning, setup, and maintenance of endpoint devices and peripherals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1473&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8eb9fdab588&quot;&gt;Support basic server and virtualization environments (e.g., VMware) as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1473&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8eb9fdab588&quot;&gt;Manage user access and device connectivity using tools such as JumpCloud, Jamf, Intune, or equivalent platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;A/V-and-On-Site-Technology-Support&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e1c1f5fae3f7&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;A/V and On-Site Technology Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1883&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af8d09cebb5d&quot;&gt;Support audio/visual systems in conference rooms and collaboration spaces, including setup, testing, and troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1883&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af8d09cebb5d&quot;&gt;Ensure reliable network and system connectivity for meetings, presentations, and company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1883&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af8d09cebb5d&quot;&gt;Coordinate with on-site staff to support day-to-day IT and A/V needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;Security-&amp;amp;-Compliance-Support&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22d23180182a&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2211&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a4a1e130807b&quot;&gt;Implement and follow IT and network security best practices, including patching, secure configurations, and access controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2211&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a4a1e130807b&quot;&gt;Assist with enforcing data protection and export-controlled data handling requirements (e.g., 10 CFR Part 810)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2211&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a4a1e130807b&quot;&gt;Support backup, recovery, and basic monitoring solutions for network-connected systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;Collaboration-&amp;amp;-Continuous-Improvement&quot; data-local-id=&quot;59cb2f0390cf&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2542&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2584&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed3dec9d243b&quot;&gt;Work closely with the IT/Cyber team to support infrastructure improvements and new technology deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2584&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed3dec9d243b&quot;&gt;Assist with network and systems upgrades, refreshes, and expansions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2584&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed3dec9d243b&quot;&gt;Document network diagrams, configurations, procedures, and troubleshooting steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2584&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed3dec9d243b&quot;&gt;Identify recurring issues and propose practical improvements to enhance reliability and user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in a Network Technician, IT Support, Systems Technician, or similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking or IT certifications such as CompTIA Network+, A+, Security+, CCNA or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience supporting network infrastructure and endpoint connectivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of macOS, Linux (Ubuntu), and Windows operating systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting A/V systems and on-site IT environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be considered a “U.S. Person” under 8 U.S.C. 1324b(a)(3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be local to Santa Clara, CA and able to provide on-site support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4363&quot; data-local-id=&quot;09be064e8280&quot;&gt;Experience with VMware or basic virtualization concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4363&quot; data-local-id=&quot;09be064e8280&quot;&gt;Familiarity with regulatory or compliance-driven environments (e.g., NIST, DOE, export controls)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4363&quot; data-local-id=&quot;09be064e8280&quot;&gt;Experience using scripting or automation tools to streamline IT or network operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2970&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5be303c07efc&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Network Systems Technician who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Has strong troubleshooting skills across networking, endpoints, and on-site systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Understands networking fundamentals such as DNS, DHCP, VLANs, routing, and switching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Is comfortable working with macOS, Linux (Ubuntu), and Windows systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Has experience with enterprise IT and networking tools (e.g., JumpCloud, Meraki, Palo Alto, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Is hands-on, detail-oriented, and comfortable working directly with hardware and users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Communicates technical information clearly and effectively to non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Can manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d62aae59a9fb&quot;&gt;Is passionate about clean energy and Oklo’s mission to make advanced fission a reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $60,000-$80,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, competitive pay, 401k, health insurance, FSA, flexible work hours, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position may involve access to information subject to U.S. export control laws. Only applicants who meet the definition of a U.S. person under applicable laws may be eligible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
