&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Fluency with Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with modern object oriented languages, preferably C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proficiency with high performance computing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with fast reactor design and analysis is highly recommended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proficiency with MCNP and SERPENT is highly recommended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proficiency with ORNL’s SCALE code system (TRITON, KENO, SAMPLER, etc.) is recommended.&lt;/li&gt;
