&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of large scale fabrication techniques and transportation/handling of large components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of thermal-mechanical analysis principles, with experience designing for high-temperature environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of nuclear fission and radiation effects on materials and components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with high tolerance machining techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of manufacturing processes including precision machining.&lt;/li&gt;
