&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Rust&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1744&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Typescript/Javascript (especially Svelte)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1804&quot;&gt;Experience in growing small software organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1858&quot;&gt;Experience working with large data collection pipelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1917&quot;&gt;Experience with optimization, statistics and design of experiments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1987&quot;&gt;Knowledge of GitLab CI/CD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2016&quot;&gt;Prior work developing and implementing software quality assurance programs and testing, especially in quality-focused industries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2148&quot;&gt;Curiosity and passion for nuclear power, closing the nuclear fuel cycle, and sustainable energy generation&lt;/p&gt;
